   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ACCORD Medling 2022-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this support is Building Inclusive and Multi-dimensional Approaches and Capacities for Effective Conflict Prevention in Africa.  

The intervention covers 3 result areas:
1) Enhanced Institutional Responses of the AU and RECS to Prevent Complex Conflicts 
2) Strengthened Capacities of National and Local Infrastructures for Effective Conflict Prevention 
3) Enhanced Evidence Based Analysis to Inform Policy Support and Knowledge Production for Conflict Prevention

Key constituencies to the programme include local, national, and regional structures, such as the AU, RECs/RMs (IGAD, SADC, ECCAS), and other organisations such as the United Cities and Local Governments; Youth focused and youth-led organisations, Women focused, and women led organisations and Networks (FemWise-Africa and GIMAC); Community leaders; and Faith-based and traditional leaders.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;let med detta st&#xf6;d &#xe4;r &quot;Att bygga inkluderande och flerdimensionella strategier och kapaciteter f&#xf6;r effektivt f&#xf6;rebyggande av konflikter i Afrika&quot;.

Insatsen omfattar 3 resultatomr&#xe5;den:
(1) F&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad institutionell respons fr&#xe5;n AU och REC att f&#xf6;rhindra komplexa konflikter
(2) F&#xf6;rst&#xe4;rkt kapacitet hos nationella och lokala infrastrukturer f&#xf6;r effektivt konfliktf&#xf6;rebyggande
(3) F&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad evidensbaserad analys f&#xf6;r att informera policyst&#xf6;d och kunskapsproduktion kring konfliktf&#xf6;rebyggande

Nyckelakt&#xf6;rer f&#xf6;r programmet inkluderar lokala, nationella och regionala strukturer, s&#xe5;som AU, REC/RMs (IGAD, SADC, ECCAS) och andra organisationer som F&#xf6;renta St&#xe4;der och lokala myndigheter; ungdomsorganisationer, kvinnoorganisationer och n&#xe4;tverk (FemWise-Africa och GIMAC); lokala ledare; och trosbaserade- och traditionella ledare</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this support is &#x201c;Building Inclusive and Multi-dimensional Approaches and Capacities for Effective Conflict Prevention in Africa&#x201d;.  

The intervention covers 3 result areas:
(1) Enhanced Institutional Responses of the AU and RECs to Prevent Complex Conflicts 
(2) Strengthened Capacities of National and Local Infrastructures for Effective Conflict Prevention 
(3) Enhanced Evidence Based Analysis to Inform Policy Support and Knowledge Production for Conflict Prevention

Key constituencies to the programme include local, national and regional structures, such as the AU, RECs/RMs (IGAD, SADC, ECCAS), and other organisations such as the United Cities and Local Governments; Youth focused and youth-led organisations, Women focused, and women led organisations and Networks (FemWise-Africa and GIMAC); Community leaders; and Faith-based and traditional leaders</narrative>
  </description>
